assroom, followed be research and investigation, the preparation and presentation of concept designs, and then design elaboration in the designer\u2019s studio. &nbsp;It culminates in presentation of the results and public display.&nbsp;The design discipline is architecture and the children are 9-10 years old.&nbsp; Activate the following sequence of slides to see the activities.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns alignfull stk-block-columns stk-block stk-a2c4e49\" data-block-id=\"a2c4e49\"><style>.stk-a2c4e49{margin-top:0px !important;margin-bottom:0px !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-a2c4e49-column alignfull\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-dbfae08 stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"dbfae08\"><style>.stk-dbfae08{background-color:#def0f5 !important;padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:20% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:20% !important}.stk-dbfae08:before{background-color:#def0f5 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-dbfae08{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:10% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:10% !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-dbfae08{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:5% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:5% !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-dbfae08-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-dbfae08-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-5f61c22\" id=\"1-introduction-by-the-teachers\" data-block-id=\"5f61c22\"><style>.stk-5f61c22 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important;color:#117cb5 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-5f61c22 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-5f61c22 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:1.7rem !important}}<\/style><h2 class=\"stk-block-heading__text has-text-color has-blue-color has-text-align-center\">1. Introduction by the teachers<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-blue-color has-text-color has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Classroom teachers, using teaching resources provided by CCAC, teach the children about climate science and the causes and effects of global warming. &nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-blue-color has-text-color has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Using the \u2018What is Design?\u2019 resource children learn about what designers do and the potential for innovative design to solve intractable problems.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-blue-color has-text-color has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Practising designers then join the class<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5.jpg\" data-lbwps-width=\"1280\" data-lbwps-height=\"842\" data-lbwps-srcsmall=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"674\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"Introduction\" class=\"wp-image-3019 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-300x197.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-768x505.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-304x200.jpg 304w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5-190x125.jpg 190w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/General-Teaching-Amy-5.jpg 1280w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/674;\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-de43d03\" data-block-id=\"de43d03\"><style>.stk-de43d03 .stk-block-text__text{color:#117cb5 !important}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-blue-color has-text-align-center\"><\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns alignfull stk-block-columns stk-block stk-48a4e65\" id=\"research\" data-block-id=\"48a4e65\"><style>.stk-48a4e65{margin-top:0px !important;margin-bottom:0px !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-48a4e65-column alignfull\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-db3536a stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"db3536a\"><style>.stk-db3536a{background-color:#844392 !important;padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:20% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:20% !important}.stk-db3536a:before{background-color:#844392 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-db3536a{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:10% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:10% !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-db3536a{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:5% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:5% !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-db3536a-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-db3536a-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-2b3b87b\" id=\"researchtitle\" data-block-id=\"2b3b87b\"><style>.stk-2b3b87b .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-2b3b87b .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-2b3b87b .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:1.7rem !important}}<\/style><h2 class=\"stk-block-heading__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">2. Research and investigation<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-a477591\" data-block-id=\"a477591\"><style>.stk-a477591 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-a477591 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-a477591 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">Children carry out their own research into materials, energy consumption and production?, construction and ecology. This work establishes the link between climate and the design discipline.<\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2.jpg\" data-lbwps-width=\"1920\" data-lbwps-height=\"1080\" data-lbwps-srcsmall=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-200x113.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Research\" class=\"wp-image-3047 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-356x200.jpg 356w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2-200x113.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Design_steps-2.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/576;\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-d743559\" data-block-id=\"d743559\"><style>.stk-d743559 .stk-block-text__text{color:#ffffff !important}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\"><\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns alignfull stk-block-columns stk-block stk-ee04b8a\" id=\"scenario-settings\" data-block-id=\"ee04b8a\"><style>.stk-ee04b8a{margin-top:0px !important;margin-bottom:0px !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-ee04b8a-column alignfull\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-c6be507 stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"c6be507\"><style>.stk-c6be507{background-color:#00b0cc !important;padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:20% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:20% !important}.stk-c6be507:before{background-color:#00b0cc !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-c6be507{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:10% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:10% !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-c6be507{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:5% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:5% !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-c6be507-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-c6be507-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-c71c0f7\" id=\"researchtitle\" data-block-id=\"c71c0f7\"><style>.stk-c71c0f7 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-c71c0f7 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-c71c0f7 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:1.7rem !important}}<\/style><h2 class=\"stk-block-heading__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">3. Scenario Settings<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-d4b98ef\" data-block-id=\"d4b98ef\"><style>.stk-d4b98ef .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-d4b98ef .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-d4b98ef .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">Children imagine their situation and write scenarios set in 2050, envisaging life in a climate changed world \u2013 hot, cold, or wet.<\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-3e92568\" data-block-id=\"3e92568\"><style>.stk-3e92568 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-3e92568 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-3e92568 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">A school scenario:<\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-66ac6ad\" data-block-id=\"66ac6ad\"><style>.stk-66ac6ad .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#def0f5 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-66ac6ad .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-66ac6ad .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-light-blue-color has-text-align-center\"><em>&#8220;The UK has turned very hot and dry. There has been a brood of cobras and they are getting away. But luckily we discovered a plant that\u2019s juice is poison. But it is bad for children\u2019s skin so this school will protect them from the cobras by building a large wall. They farm camels and take water from their humps. They also gather cactus juice for a treat. They have two sandstorm safety rooms that fit up to 70 people. The school has 120 children and 20 teachers.&#8221;<\/em><\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"Scenario Settings\" class=\"wp-image-3146 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01-188x125.jpg 188w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/eucalyptus-26-01.jpg 1280w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/682;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-2f13ad8\" data-block-id=\"2f13ad8\"><style>.stk-2f13ad8 .stk-block-text__text{color:#ffffff !important}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\"><\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns alignfull stk-block-columns stk-block stk-35a67b5\" id=\"childrens-designs\" data-block-id=\"35a67b5\"><style>.stk-35a67b5{margin-top:0px !important;margin-bottom:0px !important}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-35a67b5-column alignfull\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ad2ed34 stk-block-background\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"ad2ed34\"><style>.stk-ad2ed34{background-color:#ed7303 !important;padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:20% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:20% !important}.stk-ad2ed34:before{background-color:#ed7303 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-ad2ed34{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:10% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:10% !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-ad2ed34{padding-top:10% !important;padding-right:5% !important;padding-bottom:10% !important;padding-left:5% !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ad2ed34-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ad2ed34-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-760a974\" id=\"researchtitle\" data-block-id=\"760a974\"><style>.stk-760a974 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-760a974 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:2.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-760a974 .stk-block-heading__text{font-size:1.7rem !important}}<\/style><h2 class=\"stk-block-heading__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">4. Children\u2019s designs<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-0782454\" data-block-id=\"0782454\"><style>.stk-0782454 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-0782454 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-0782454 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">In small teams, children prepare their designs for, in this case, a school in its climatic setting in 2050, prompted and guided by teachers and designers. <\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"721\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-1024x721.jpg\" alt=\"Children's designs\" class=\"wp-image-3151 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-1024x721.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-300x211.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-768x541.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-1536x1082.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-284x200.jpg 284w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted-178x125.jpg 178w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/E4-team14022020-GP32-adjusted.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smu