olor has-text-align-center\">5. Presentation<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-444670b\" data-block-id=\"444670b\"><style>.stk-444670b .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#844392 !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-444670b .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-444670b .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-purple-color has-text-align-center\">Children present their designs to a small expert panel and the designer. The panel selects representative concepts for further professional elaboration by the designer.<\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Student presentation\" class=\"wp-image-3155 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-356x200.jpg 356w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1-200x113.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Student-Presentation-1.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/576;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stacka