"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-e18edc9\" data-block-id=\"e18edc9\"><style>.stk-e18edc9 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important;color:#ffffff !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-e18edc9 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.5rem !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-e18edc9 .stk-block-text__text{font-size:1.3rem !important}}<\/style><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-color has-white-color has-text-align-center\">The representative designs are developed and elaborated in the designer\u2019s studio with, where possible, interaction and visits from the children.<\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"Desert School Sketch\" class=\"wp-image-3158 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-267x200.jpg 267w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch-167x125.jpg 167w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/19002_200618_DesertSchool_Edited_Sketch.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/768;\" \/><\/fig